case ok-unsupported-verb
desc an unknown verb is answered with ACTION_ERR naming it, not silence
module yes
send addon-self version
frame addon WHISPER_SELF TBM version
recv addon WHISPER TBM version
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:ACTION_ERR|version|unsupported|not available on this server yet
expect err.count 1
expect err.0.intent version
expect err.0.code unsupported
expect err.0.message not available on this server yet
expect ignored.count 1
expect problems.count 0
